Well, since you're seeing dragons, sooner or later a silver one will be
created. With some luck it'll leave scales. You can also try to reverse
geno silver dragons (be sure to set up the environment to your advantage,
with lots of E-words). There's a reasonable chance of a shield of
reflection at Medusa's, but that's a long way from where you are. If you
have surplus magical armor and a /oPoly, you can try your luck with
polypiling. Ultimately, if you can get a wish, SDSM is worth it (provided
you have MR; otherwise, choose an "AoR or [SoR). Magic lamps, thrones,
smoky potions and fountains can give wishes (careful with the fountains,
though). And wands, obviously.

